Package: NonparaTransport
Title: Nonparanormal Transport for Multivariate Distributional Data Analysis
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R:
    c(
        person("Junyoung", "Park", email = "junyoup@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
        person("Irina", "Gaynanova", email = "irinagn@umich.edu", role = "aut"),
        person("Edward", "Shao", email = "eshao@umich.edu", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Computational tools for multivariate distributional data 
    (collections of multivariate distributions per data point) under the 
    nonparanormal (Gaussian copula) modeling. Provides fast C++ computation 
    of nonparanormal transport (NPT) metric and the pairwise NPT matrix.
    Supports Fréchet regression of multivariate distributional responses 
    on Euclidean covariates, component-wise R-squared for goodness-of-fit 
    measurements, permutation-based hypothesis testing, and bivariate 
    density visualization.
